<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following step-up callable pfandbrief bond was announced by lead manager Helaba.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMINE HYPOTHEKEN BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY   *27.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFURT     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 28.APR.97 THEN 4.70 PCT.</p>
<p>	     *CALLABLE 28.APR.97.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
